And I even get to do it with
two of our rock star engineers.

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:25.120
I've got with me Mikayla
as well as Karthik,

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:27.120
and they've actually built
a lot of the features

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:28.773
we're about to show you.

00:00:28.773 --> 00:00:30.690
The way I want to start
is just by making sure

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:33.150
that everyone knows everything
that you're about to see

00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:34.500
is publicly available.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.090
Go out, kick the tires on it.

